      ],
      "description": "SECONDARY LOAD INDICATOR FOR llm2. SM clock boosts under compute load and drops back toward idle when the GPU is quiet, so its shape tracks activity even though MIG hides DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL. Read it alongside Power Draw.",
      "title": "Clock Speeds (SM / Memory) — secondary load indicator for llm2",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },

